 "finalMessage": "Fixed implicit tag closing in the HTML parser to match browsers.\n\nChanges in src/Parser.ts (openImpliesClose):\n- `<li>` now implies closing an open `<p>` (set became {li, p}).\n- `dd`/`dt` share `ddtTags`, now {dd, dt, p}, so a new term/description closes an open `<p>` (and the sibling term) before opening.\n- Added `listing`, `plaintext`, and `xmp` entries (pTag) so those start tags close an open `"
